<title>USA: TABLE - Olin Corp Q2 net drops.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Olin Corp Q2 net drops.</headline>
<dateline>NORWALK, Conn. 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			   $0.75		    $1.01</p>
<p> Net			  38,600		   51,700</p>
<p> Revs			632,400		  701,700</p>
<p>			6  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			   $1.56		    $1.88</p>
<p> Net			  80,400		   96,700</p>
<p> Revs		    1,223,600		1,394,600</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Shr is primary.</p>
<p>Fully diluted shr is $0.75 vs $0.98 for Q2 and $1.55 vs $1.83 for six months.</p>
<p>Q2 1996 net includes income from discontinued opers of $0.02 per primary and diluted shr.</p>
<p>Six months 1996 net includes loss from discontinued opers of $0.10 per primary shr and $0.09 per diluted shr.</p>
</text>
